Package: semidentify
Type: Package
Title: Evaluate SEM Identification Rules
Version: 0.4.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      "Zach", "Vig",
      email = "zachvig@unc.edu",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
  )
Description: Provides rule-based checks for selected necessary and sufficient
    identification conditions in structural equation models (SEMs), including
    latent-variable scaling constraints. Diagnostic messages explain rule
    failures and support model specification and respecification.
